    {
      "text": "でんげきを　あびせて　こうげきする。\nのこった　でんきを　ためて　じぶんの\nとくこうを　あげることが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "전격의 다발을 상대에게\n발사한다. 전기를 모아서 자신의\n특수공격을 올릴 때가 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur tire un rayon chargé d’électricité.\nPeut aussi augmenter son Attaque Spéciale.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Greift mit einer elektrischen Entladung an.\nDer Spezial-Angriff des Angreifers steigt eventuell.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Quien lo usa ataca al objetivo como un remolino.\nCuanto más lento sea quien lo usa, más daño\ncausa.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa lancia un fascio di elettricità molto\nintensa. Può anche aumentare il proprio Attacco\nSpeciale.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user attacks with an electric\ncharge. The user may use any remaining\nelectricity to raise its Sp. Atk stat.",
      "version_group": {
